-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">是的；对；没错；嗯；呃；那个；咦；什么；哎；唉；怎么又是我；好；好的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202181\">「テニスをしましょうか」「ええ」</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">“我可以打网球吗?”“是的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n5:v:駅\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">駅</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">车站</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>駅<rp>(</rp><rt>えき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>歩<rp>(</rp><rt>ある</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>十分<rp>(</rp><rt>じっぷん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">走到车站要十分钟。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">エレベーター</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">电梯；升降机；（飞机的）升降舵</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227886\">エレベーターはどこですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">电梯在哪里？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/351255\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">鉛筆</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんぴつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=